    "Broken case: same-experience NoWrite0/6 versus Direct/FrozenLearned/Validated5/6. Protective case: NoWrite/FrozenLearned/Validated5/6 versus Direct4/6. Plant all0/6. No blanket repair, no requirement to improve every case.",
    "Across all3 cases, FrozenLearned and Validated have exact matching6 main raw and posttaskR+L/I each. Frozen onlinework21roll/89K/49nonsharedTX versus Validated30/116/70. Historical labels were paid previously; do not claim reduced full discovery cost or matched CPU.",
